  "about": "Community PowerShell tools DE Tech Tool uses or has reviewed. Every entry is pinned to one commit. 'ship' tools (MIT) are fetched from raw.githubusercontent.com at that commit, every file checked against its sha256 before import, and cached under the data folder; a mismatch refuses the tool. 'runtime' tools (GPL/LGPL) may only be downloaded and run as separate, unmodified programs; none are bundled or copied into DE code. 'reference' repos have no licence: read for ideas and endpoints only, never copied or run. Update a pin by running packaging/update-community-catalog.py against reviewed clones, never by hand.",
